    {
      "id": "L-S1E02-C02",
      "title": "Hope and Landon argue about him leaving the school",
      "description": "Hope and Landon argue about him leaving the school",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Rafael",
          "version": "Rafael"
        },
        {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "angst",
        "knife",
        "argument"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,


       "full": {
        "turns": [
         {
          "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T01",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
          },
          "text": "I don't believe a word you're saying."
          },
          {
         "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T02",
         "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
         },
         "text": "You have every right to be mad at me, but I am telling you the truth. Come on man, help me."
        },
       {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T03",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Rafael",
          "version": "Rafael"
        },
        "text": "I believe him."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T04",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "You believe that a fire-breathing woman burned the bus alive?"
      },
      {
         "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T05",
         "speaker": {
          "character": "Rafael",
          "version": "Rafael"
         },
         "text": "Yeah."
        },
        {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T06",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "And Landon happened to be spared?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T07",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Rafael",
          "version": "Rafael"
        },
        "text": "He told you that he ran."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T08",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "And conveniently lost the knife on the way."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T09",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Rafael",
          "version": "Rafael"
        },
        "text": "Yes"
      },
      {
         "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T10",
         "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
         },
         "text": "She kept coming at me like she was gonna take it from me. She was burning everything in her path."
        },
        {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T11",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "You want to explain to me what you were doing stealing the knife in the first place?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T12",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "I don't remember stealing it."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T13",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Of course not. How about pretending to be compelled?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T14",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "That was to avoid being thrown back in the werewolf dungeon."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T15",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Transitional cellar."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T16",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Small spaces. Hope, you have to understand, Dr. Saltzman had already told me the school wasn't gonna let me stay. If he thought I'd talk, he'd lock me back up. There wasn't a good ending for me. I didn't want to steal from you and I don't want a fire-breather chasing me. I'm sorry for all of it."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T17",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Rafael",
          "version": "Rafael"
        },
        "text": "He's not lying. I know him. Now, if he says that there's a fire-breathing woman running through the woods, then there is a..."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T18",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        },
        "text": "There's a fire-breathing woman running through the woods. Did I or did I not say don't engage?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T19",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "He's only dangerous if crappy apologies can kill."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T20",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        },
        "text": "Looks can be deceiving. Now our bus refugee, turns out she's a pyromancer."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-21",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Wait, wh-what's a pyromancer?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-21",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "A fire-breathing witch. Ric, she wants the knife."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T22",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        },
        "text": "Okay, well, where is it?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-23",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "I-I lost it in the woods. I was running around in circles all night trying to find a place to hide."
      }
        
    ]
