        "id": "L-S1E02-C03-T11",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        },
        "text": "All right, great, I need a cell phone."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C03-T12",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Take your pick."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C03-T13",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "What is all this?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C02-T14",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Rafael",
          "version": "Rafael"
        },
        "text": "It's from the people on the bus."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C03-T15",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "I didn't bring it here. I..."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E02-C03-T16",
